    <string name="login_api_key_tutorial_link">How to create an API Key?</string>
    <string name="login_api_key_tutorial_title">Creating an API Key</string>
    <string name="login_api_key_tutorial_step1">1. Open your Immich Web Interface (creating keys is not supported in the mobile app).</string>
    <string name="login_api_key_tutorial_step2">2. Go to Account Settings > API Keys.</string>
    <string name="login_api_key_tutorial_step3">3. Click \"New API Key\" and name it \"Immich Swipe\".</string>
    <string name="login_api_key_tutorial_step4">4. Under Permissions, select:\n• Asset (All)\n• album.read\n• album.update\n• albumAsset.create\n• duplicate.read\n• user.read\n• userProfileImage.read</string>
    <string name="login_api_key_tutorial_step5">5. Click Create, then copy and paste the key here.</string>

